For the purposes of these Regulations, "controlled chemicals" means chemicals of the following categories:
Category 1: chemicals that may be used as chemical weapons;
Category 2: chemicals that may be used as precursors for producing chemical weapons;
Category 3: chemicals that may be used as main raw materials for producing chemical weapons;
Category 4: specific organic chemicals other than explosives and pure hydrocarbons.
The catalogue of various categories of controlled chemicals mentioned in the preceding paragraph shall be proposed by the competent chemical industry department of the State Council and promulgated after approval by the State Council.
